                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "Pros:\r\n+ Humor\r\n+ Great vibes to the entire series\r\n+ Has good length and do not drag things out\r\n+ Despite it's age, still plays great\r\n+ Better controls than the first one\r\n+ Improvement over first one in almost every way\r\n\r\nCons:\r\n- Puzzles do not use logic, but humor and are chaotic\r\n- Weird ending\r\n\r\nMonkey Island(tm) 2 is improvement over first one. The visuals, even the classic ones, are better. The new visuals seems to be drawings of old concept art, so it's true to source. Pacing is overall better. Writing and controls are improved. Puzzles are the same illogical approach as all the other Monkey Island(tm) games. You have to look at puzzle solving from the perspective of humor not logic. Ending is a bit weird. I think Ending was better in the first one, but rest of the game is better here. Another legendary adventure game that is a must play. And it still works very well even if you experience it for the first time only now.",
